All,

LPC has extended its proposal submission deadline to
midnight, PT, Monday June 22.

If you're interested in discussing/presenting on any
facet of RT, particularly development work that would
benefit from discussion, exchange with other groups
or subsystems, please submit a proposal.

We're trying to organize the current RT submissions
(more in progress) into an RT miniconf session:

http://linuxplumbersconf.org/ocw/events/2009/proposals/

We're also particularly interested in any low latency
work going on.


Conference page:
================
http://linuxplumbersconf.org/2009/


